The Starlink terminal (starlink.p3d and the starlink_*.paa textures) is based on
"Starlink Satellite Dish" by Malacodart:
https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/starlink-satellite-dish-84476761b87546d2b23fecfaaf849326

It is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
(CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Changes: scaled to the size of a Starlink Standard terminal, turned to face +Y,
converted to P3D with collision, fire and shadow LODs, textures converted to PAA
(normal map green channel inverted, specular/gloss map derived from roughness),
material for the Super shader.

Everything in this folder is licensed under CC BY 4.0.
